[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 20083.35, "timestamp": "05:34:43", "text": "我是個指關節"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20085.548, "timestamp": "05:34:45", "text": "。一關出現的鬼魂會對“待定”做出反應？ 所以，如果你說“待定”，無論"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20092.56, "timestamp": "05:34:52", "text": "你是不是一個人，它都會回應。 哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 20098.59, "timestamp": "05:34:58", "text": "什麼？"}]